{"ID":"20240314092054-c4ql8qc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092054-c4ql8qc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092054-c4ql8qc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162143-6rtm8eq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162143-y7ap766\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162143-y7ap766\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:137,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:137\u0026#125;","title":"【乌头桂枝汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422162143-6rtm8eq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-6rtm8eq","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒疝腹中痛，逆冷，手足不仁，若身疼痛，灸刺诸药不能治，抵当乌头桂枝汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-s2vvfh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-s2vvfh6","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-z8nggyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-z8nggyn","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头五枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-n3aupfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-n3aupfp","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右一味，以蜜二斤，煎减半，去滓，以桂枝汤五合解之，得一升后，初服二合，不知，即取三合；又不知，复加至五合。其知者，如醉状，得吐者，为中病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-eexz379","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-eexz379","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，这个处方，就是我用了很多的处方。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒疝，腹中痛，逆冷，手足不仁，若身疼痛者，灸刺诸药不能治，抵当乌头汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个抵当，不是什么抵当汤，就是北方人说的只有乌头桂枝汤可以治疗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-291a9hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-291a9hb","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝汤呢，是解肌，是来调和阴阳的。那当我们身上寒很盛的时候，寒在肌肉里面的时候，我们用桂枝汤，光用桂枝汤下去，桂枝只能去风啊解肌，但没有办法把这个寒去掉，这时候我们要靠乌头。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足不仁，身疼痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，这个手脚，我过去呢，我们应该在治疗类风湿性关节炎的时候，我们应该是要乌头汤，乌头汤就是用乌头，配合麻黄这个黄耆，那个黄耆啊、甘草这种......那......还有芍药，这个乌头桂枝汤跟乌头汤不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那我之所以用这个乌头桂枝汤来治疗风湿关节炎，就上次我跟诸位介绍过，因为麻黄，因为病人很多病人呢心脏都不好，开麻黄下去吃的时候，心脏都会动悸，他不好的原因可能吃西药吃得太多，造成这样子，所以我都用这个来治疗风湿关节炎的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那实际上真正的治疗那个类风湿性关节炎，应该用乌头汤，而不是用乌头桂枝汤，但是我用乌头桂枝汤，因为原因在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-o9r4c9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-o9r4c9a","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看，这个乌头呢以蜜......这样，我们用桂枝汤呢，比如说桂枝汤你用桂枝三钱，白芍三钱呐，炙甘草二钱三钱，都没有关系，生姜两片，红枣十个，你六碗水煮成两碗以后呢，乌头一样，乌头蜜啊，你看这里就是一味药，以蜜二升煎煮，减半，然后把渣去掉，这个怎么去渣啊？那个这个蜂蜜煮下去不得了了。诸位，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就两个乌头，用两碗水去煮成一碗，这个时候把乌头渣丢掉，变成一碗的乌头汤，乌头汤再配合一碗的蜂蜜，两个下去，两碗煮成一碗，然后吃的时候加一匙蜂蜜下去（桂枝汤里面）就可以了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162143-y7ap766","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162143-y7ap766","updated":"20240422162143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那吃下去以后，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其知者如醉状，得吐者为中病"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，就是这个乌头这个非常热性的药，它到四肢全身四肢手足上去，到处去流串，把肌肉里面的寒湿，还有胃里面的寒湿、胸腔里面的寒湿，通通排掉，这个就是乌头。真正我刚刚一再跟诸位讲，经方在厉节篇里面的时候，我们是用乌头汤，不是这个乌头桂枝汤。"}]}]}